          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Each Legislative Data Group can contain only one legal entity that acts as a payroll statutory unit."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Legislative Data Group supports the configuration of objects with a strong legislative context, such as payroll, absence types, elements, and rates of pay."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. It is required to associate country and currency details while defining Legislative Data Group."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Legislative Data Groups can span enterprises."
            }
          ]
        },
        "E": {
          "content": [
